		(uuid "562666c7-ecc6-46ff-a371-92a7b7ede813")
	)
	(text "One balanced output (XLR), one channel. Build it twice: L takes HPL, R takes HPR. docs/balanced-outputs.md, D15.\nA = unity follower (hot), B = unity inverter (cold). Codec full scale gives 2.0 V rms pin 2 to pin 3 (+8.2 dBu) on Line, -20 dB on Mic.\nK2 de-energised shorts X to VREF: muted at boot, in panic bypass and on any failure. Its coil is wired in parallel with the bypass relay's.\nSW3, J15, SW4 and C22 are panel parts. Pin 1 goes to the case through the lift switch, never to this board's ground."
		(at 22.86 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "feccb11b-b3f9-4149-931a-0601fa9d231b")
	)
	(text "TQ2-5V, the stripboard's pin numbers (component side, as on the bypass relay board):\ncoil + 1, coil - 10; pole 1: COM 4, NC 2, NO 5; pole 2: COM 7, NC 9, NO 6.\nBoth poles mute in parallel, for contact reliability. Check with a meter before wiring."
		(at 63.5 124.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3e975039-e1a2-461b-9cc9-fe14baf249a9")
	)
	(text "Phantom: C17/C18 are 63 V bipolar (the DC across them reverses).\nD8-D11 take the pulse when a pin shorts with the cap charged;\nR34/R35 keep it out of the op-amp. R36/R37 hold the pins at 0 V."
		(at 167.64 121.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "158ab356-f39d-4615-acc9-8df952dd3288")
	)
	(text "Supply and VREF: 9 V filtered by R40/C20/C21. VREF = 4.5 V,\nrising over about 2.4 s (R38/R39/C19), so power-up is a slow ramp, not a thump."
		(at 48.26 185.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "af46c34a-2b17-468d-86ca-7e7407470ecb")
	)
